  "description": "Please note the parameters for the upcoming data extraction: the time window runs from **1622505600** to **1622592000**, giving a total **duration of 86400 seconds**. Data points will be sampled at a **resolution of 60 seconds** and the aggregation method to be applied is **MEAN**. We are interested in the attributes **temperature** and **humidity_level**.\n\nThe query should be limited to devices that carry the tags **location = Warehouse-1** and **type = sensor**, specifically the devices identified by the IDs **a1b2c3d4e5f60718293a4b5c** and **deadbeefcafebabefeedface**. The result set must not exceed **500** records and should be returned in **descending** order.",
